    </li> <heading id="h-0013">Example 1(d)</heading>
    <li> <para-num num="[0115]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0121" num="0115" class="description-line">In another embodiment a PP/PE/PP trilayer was formed and tested like in Example 1(c) hereinabove, except that the thickness of the PP and PE layers were varied. The PP layers were thicker and the PE layer was thinner. The results of the tests are presented in Table 4 below:</div>
    </li> <li> <div id="p-0122" num="0000" class="description-line">
