    </li> <li> <para-num num="[0124]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0136" num="0124" class="description-line">In accordance with at least certain embodiments, here are respective TDC examples without and with a pin removal force reducing additive (to lower the pin removal force or COF) and their respective average pin removal force. The results are shown in Table 10 below.</div>
    </li> <li> <div id="p-0137" num="0000" class="description-line">
      <tables id="TABLE-US-00010" num="00010">
        <patent-tables frame="none" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
